  "cover_text": "This class includes 10 hours of instruction: three weeknight classes (twice weekly) that begin in August. The class is only available through Yale’s Enforced Class Work (ECW) program; an online extension of College Direct. For students enrolled in Yale College, summer is an ideal time for a class or a learning opportunity. Regal College uses the class only as a bridge towards applying to hold a graduate program at Yale, to designate a particular course work program for academic credit toward a graduate degree, or as a resource for supplemental instruction",
